(7680556, 1256601, 114285, '<td valign="top">I feel like this could be Mary Anns image, I love the subtlety in the muted colours.</td>', 'I feel like this could be Mary Anns image, I love the subtlety in the muted colours.', '2020-11-30 21:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680568, 1256646, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like all the elements of your still life and the lighting. I also appreciate that you used cloth in your composition which is prevalent in the old masters work.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'I like all the elements of your still life and the lighting. I also appreciate that you used cloth in your composition which is prevalent in the old masters work.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-11-30 22:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680570, 1256622, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and the lighting is wonderful.  I always like to use texture in my still life images and this is perfect. The colors are subtle and the composition simple, the makings of a lovely still life.  Thank you for participating.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and the lighting is wonderful.  I always like to use texture in my still life images and this is perfect. The colors are subtle and the composition simple, the makings of a lovely still life.  Thank you for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680571, 1256636, 109227, '<td valign="top">Orchids always make a lovely image.  The backlighting works well to show off the delicate petals.  Nicely done and thank you for participating.</td>', 'Orchids always make a lovely image.  The backlighting works well to show off the delicate petals.  Nicely done and thank you for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680572, 1256632, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast here and a great find on that single bench with light.  I am always looking for that light!  Thank you for participating.</td>', 'Nice contrast here and a great find on that single bench with light.  I am always looking for that light!  Thank you for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680573, 1256606, 109227, '<td valign="top">Aww, I am a sucker for fur babies and like that you honor them as part of your family.  The contrast between the two works well.  Thank you so much for participating.</td>', 'Aww, I am a sucker for fur babies and like that you honor them as part of your family.  The contrast between the two works well.  Thank you so much for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680574, 1256380, 109227, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light, simple composition, and soft colors.  Happy to see you use a cloth element which is very prevalent in the old masters work.  I really like that bowl!  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Gorgeous light, simple composition, and soft colors.  Happy to see you use a cloth element which is very prevalent in the old masters work.  I really like that bowl!  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-11-30 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680575, 1256425, 109227, '<td valign="top">And a beautiful tribute it is too.  I love the softness of the light and the delicate flowers.  The frame is a great addition as well as the textured table.  Very nicely done.  Thank you for participating.</td>', 'And a beautiful tribute it is too.  I love the softness of the light and the delicate flowers.  The frame is a great addition as well as the textured table.  Very nicely done.  Thank you for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680576, 1256645, 109227, '<td valign="top">I am always drawn to shadows and this looks something I would photograph.  The background is perfect for this type of image.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'I am always drawn to shadows and this looks something I would photograph.  The background is perfect for this type of image.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-11-30 22:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680577, 1256642, 109227, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely composition!  The colors combined with all the textures and nice light are wonderful and then that touch of white abstract art brings it all together.  Very well done.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Such a lovely composition!  The colors combined with all the textures and nice light are wonderful and then that touch of white abstract art brings it all together.  Very well done.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-11-30 22:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680578, 1256555, 109227, '<td valign="top">You have captured the light beautifully and the composition looks so joyful.  I love your title.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'You have captured the light beautifully and the composition looks so joyful.  I love your title.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-11-30 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680579, 1256523, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is food photography done well.  I like the soft color palette.  This looks good enough to eat.  Thank you for participating.</td>', 'This is food photography done well.  I like the soft color palette.  This looks good enough to eat.  Thank you for participating.', '2020-11-30 22:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680580, 1256463, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity, the background looks like it could be Mary Anns image, but she doesnt normally centre her images, so Im not sure if this is hers.</td>', 'I love the simplicity, the background looks like it could be Mary Anns image, but she doesnt normally centre her images, so Im not sure if this is hers.', '2020-11-30 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680605, 1256651, 109227, '<td valign="top">I am always drawn to shadows and how they dance with the light.  The light on the tips of the flowers brings them to life that combined with the simple composition is very appealing.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'I am always drawn to shadows and how they dance with the light.  The light on the tips of the flowers brings them to life that combined with the simple composition is very appealing.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680606, 1256650, 109227, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is gorgeous and is a great background for the leaves.  I like taking photos through a window for the softness it lends.  Nicely composed image and something I would do.  Thank you for participating.</td>', 'The bokeh is gorgeous and is a great background for the leaves.  I like taking photos through a window for the softness it lends.  Nicely composed image and something I would do.  Thank you for participating.', '2020-12-01 09:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680611, 1256299, 109227, '<td valign="top">Happenstance images are the best surprises.  I carry my camera or phone with me when I walk just for those moments. Nature in winter is beautiful and you have captured its essence.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Happenstance images are the best surprises.  I carry my camera or phone with me when I walk just for those moments. Nature in winter is beautiful and you have captured its essence.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680612, 1256638, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is so charming and whimsical.  The play with light is excellent and I really like that container.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'This is so charming and whimsical.  The play with light is excellent and I really like that container.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680613, 1256408, 109227, '<td valign="top">The wonder of nature never gets old.  The light is gorgeous and you have captured it well.  The complimentary colors of the bird and grass make a nice composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'The wonder of nature never gets old.  The light is gorgeous and you have captured it well.  The complimentary colors of the bird and grass make a nice composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680614, 1256623, 109227, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and soft glistening grass makes a great composition.  Nature abounds with beauty if you only look.  You have found it.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Wonderful light and soft glistening grass makes a great composition.  Nature abounds with beauty if you only look.  You have found it.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680615, 1256601, 109227, '<td valign="top">Two of my favorite things, hydrangea and old bottles.  I am happy to see you use of cloth in the composition, as it is prevalent in the old masters still life works.  I really like the color palette and the textures.  Very well done.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Two of my favorite things, hydrangea and old bottles.  I am happy to see you use of cloth in the composition, as it is prevalent in the old masters still life works.  I really like the color palette and the textures.  Very well done.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680616, 1256422, 109227, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful, two things I strive for but not always accomplish.  I love your composition, the colors, softness and the textures.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful, two things I strive for but not always accomplish.  I love your composition, the colors, softness and the textures.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680617, 1256384, 109227, '<td valign="top">You have captured the light very well, something I am always striving to do to bring out the best in each element of a still life.  I like all the natural elements and I especially like the watering can.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'You have captured the light very well, something I am always striving to do to bring out the best in each element of a still life.  I like all the natural elements and I especially like the watering can.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680618, 1256393, 109227, '<td valign="top">The subtle light and the natural elements make a beautiful composition.  Autumn still life images are the most appealing to me and I like this one.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'The subtle light and the natural elements make a beautiful composition.  Autumn still life images are the most appealing to me and I like this one.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680621, 1256577, 109227, '<td valign="top">I love nature images, especially in fall and winter.  You have to look for beauty, as it blends in during this time of the year.  You have found it and captured its essence.  The colors and soft background work well.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'I love nature images, especially in fall and winter.  You have to look for beauty, as it blends in during this time of the year.  You have found it and captured its essence.  The colors and soft background work well.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680623, 1256634, 109227, '<td valign="top">Those soft seeds work so well with the beautiful lighting.  I like the contrast of the dark background and the simple, elegant composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Those soft seeds work so well with the beautiful lighting.  I like the contrast of the dark background and the simple, elegant composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680630, 1256640, 109227, '<td valign="top">In my years with DPC I have learned to appreciate and like abstract photography.  Taking the time to really seek out what the photographer sees in the image is part of the experience.  The mystery here is intriguing; I think I see a tiger, lol.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'In my years with DPC I have learned to appreciate and like abstract photography.  Taking the time to really seek out what the photographer sees in the image is part of the experience.  The mystery here is intriguing; I think I see a tiger, lol.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680633, 1256595, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nature is wonderful, the more you look the more you see.  The mushrooms against the dark background and the textures make an excellent composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Nature is wonderful, the more you look the more you see.  The mushrooms against the dark background and the textures make an excellent composition.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680635, 1256648, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light captured well.  I am always in awe of those who do landscapes well; I can;t seem to do it.  This is composed very well and is lovely.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Beautiful light captured well.  I am always in awe of those who do landscapes well; I can;t seem to do it.  This is composed very well and is lovely.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680637, 1256536, 109227, '<td valign="top">Yes, nature is beautiful and I like your subject choice.  The butterfly and flowers pose just speak to a photographer saying look at me.  Nicely composed and the bokeh is lovely.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Yes, nature is beautiful and I like your subject choice.  The butterfly and flowers pose just speak to a photographer saying look at me.  Nicely composed and the bokeh is lovely.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7680639, 1256625, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the light and the Lovely, mysterious model.  The bw tones are equally nice.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the light and the Lovely, mysterious model.  The bw tones are equally nice.  Thank you for participating, I am honored.', '2020-12-01 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
